# Atlas Core - Lean Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Sable Bishop  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D15 17:00  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Cost-optimized, streamlined design token architecture for Atlas Core components. Incorporates requirements from Business Document: Company Document to unify SaaS and Face-to-Face service interfaces with minimal overhead.

